  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Thinly slice carrot and zucchini into half-moons. Finely chop or crush garlic. Cut Malaysian tofu into 2cm cubes.\n• In a small bowl, combine sweet chilli sauce, soy sauce, rice wine vinegar and a good splash of water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d21b842fe3fe0cd20eb06a/step-e0b36e6e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat.\n• Cook tofu, turning until browned, 3-4 mins. Transfer to a plate.\n• Meanwhile, cook udon noodles in boiling water over high heat until tender, 3-4 mins. In the last min of cook time, gently stir the noodles with a fork to separate. Drain, rinse and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d21b842fe3fe0cd20eb06a/step-6645ccc3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook carrot and zucchini, tossing, until softened, 4-5 mins.\n• Stir in ginger paste and garlic, and cook until fragrant, 1 min. Season.\n• Stir in noodles, tofu and sauce and cook until slightly reduced, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d21b842fe3fe0cd20eb06a/step-9ca15240.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide noodles between bowls.\n• Top with crushed peanuts.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d21b842fe3fe0cd20eb06a/step-b28eaf86.jpg"
    }
  ]
